---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Cherokee Home Pros">
  <article class="max-w-2xl prose prose-slate">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">About this directory</h1>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-700">
      Cherokee Home Pros is a small, local directory of contractors who actually work
      Canton, Woodstock, Holly Springs, Ball Ground and nearby North Atlanta cities.
    </p>

    <p>
      It is not Angi, Thumbtack, or a statewide lead mill. The goal is simple: when your
      septic needs pumping, your pool turns green, or a storm takes part of the roof,
      you can find a few real options and request quotes without calling ten random numbers.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">How listings are chosen</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-slate-700">
      <li>Local presence in Cherokee or adjacent cities that routinely serve the area</li>
      <li>Clear service categories (septic, pool, roofing, HVAC, etc.)</li>
      <li>Phone number and, when available, a real website</li>
      <li>No guarantee of quality — always verify license, insurance, and recent reviews yourself</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">How the quote form works</h2>
    <p>
      You submit a service and city. The request is forwarded to a few matching pros.
      They contact you. There is no charge to homeowners for the request itself.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">For contractors</h2>
    <p>
      Want to be listed or featured? Reach out after the site is live. Featured placement
      and lead routing will be available once quote volume is steady.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-slate-500">
      Independent project. Not affiliated with any listed company, Cherokee County
      government, or national lead platforms.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
